{"id":"22.10.CarpetCleaning","contentHtml":"<p>This project is a technical research on creating a <strong>visually complex but performant</strong> interactive pile effect using <code>HLSL</code>.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Goal:</strong> simulate dense, physically reactive pile on a <strong>flat mesh</strong>, achieving maximum quality with minimal performance costs.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Update 2025:</strong> The project has been visually updated.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2>Challenge</h2>\n<p>The main challenge is to create dense and dynamic pile via a shader.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Engineering Solution</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Pile Simulation (<code>Shell Texturing</code>):</strong> The shader renders <mark>dozens of layers</mark> of texture, creating an illusion of volume on a flat mesh.</li>\n<li><strong>Simple Control:</strong> Interactivity is implemented by passing <mark>force vectors</mark> to the shader, which allows <strong>easy and cheap simulation control</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>Cleaning Mechanics:</strong> Implemented via <code>Render Texture</code>, which separates cleaning logic from the complex pile shader.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>Outcome</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Optimization:</strong> The effect works with high performance on mobile devices.</li>\n<li><strong>Flexibility and Control:</strong> The shader approach ensured full and cheap control over the simulation.</li>\n<li><strong>Key Competency:</strong> The project proves mastery of <code>HLSL</code> for <mark>solving real optimization tasks</mark>, not just for creating beautiful effects.</li>\n</ul>\n","published":true,"title":"Carpet Cleaning","date":"2022-10","type":"project","tagsArray":["Demo","Mobile","Unity","C#","HLSL","VFX","Photoshop","Illustrator","Blender"],"heroVideo":["jZRNQo95GPo"],"shortDescription":"<p>Tech demo: <strong>High-performance parallax shader</strong> simulating interactive carpet fur using multi-pass rendering.</p>\n","storeLinks":null,"role":"solo","projectIcon":"/images/projects/22.10.CarpetCleaning/icon.webp","cardBackground":"/images/projects/22.10.CarpetCleaning/card.mp4?v=1765047192721","screenshots":[{"src":"/images/projects/22.10.CarpetCleaning/screenshots/1.webp","width":526,"height":936},{"src":"/images/projects/22.10.CarpetCleaning/screenshots/2.webp","width":526,"height":936},{"src":"/images/projects/22.10.CarpetCleaning/screenshots/3.webp","width":526,"height":936},{"src":"/images/projects/22.10.CarpetCleaning/screenshots/4.webp","width":526,"height":936}]}